      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Static By Default",
      "items": [
        "Finance, Tech, AI, Space, and the flight map ship cached JSON",
        "Exporters commit atomically, so Pages never serves a partial file",
        "Each producer workflow dispatches its own ingest job"
